                        </p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section id="choices" class="legal-section">
                    <span class="legal-section-number">07</span>
                    <div>
                        <span class="legal-section-kicker">LIMITATIONS</span>
                        <h2>Information is provided on an <em>as-available</em> basis.</h2>
